* Crypto hacks 2020
** Figures
*** Chainalysis: ~$520M stolen, ~30% DeFi
*** CipherTrace: ~$1.9B incl. fraud
*** SlowMist: ~$411M, frauds and accidents excluded
*** LuBian ~127k BTC: found in 2025, kept apart
** KuCoin ~$150M to ~$281M
*** Hot-wallet keys leaked
*** ~84% recovered, Lazarus (Chainalysis)
** DeFi summer
*** First flash-loan attacks (bZx)
*** ERC-777 reentrancy (Lendf.Me, Uniswap v1)
*** Share prices from Curve (Harvest, Value DeFi)
*** Arbitrary calls (Pickle), reward bugs (Cover)
** Users and chains
*** SIM swap (~$45M), Electrum phishing
*** 51% attacks on Ethereum Classic
** Not counted
*** Frauds: Wirecard, BitClub, OneCoin, Compounder
*** Accidents: YFV, Saffron, Maker Black Thursday, YAM
@endmindmap
